 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude:H-SU/PGSLICE",
  "branch": "claude/hsu-pgslice-d4c",
  "tag": "r4",
  "purpose": "r4: pin registers share the lane root (r3 gate with a separate pin root: 3,303 pin->lane hops under the cross-root hold reserve, FF hold -111.7 ps, repair stuck at -89.4 on x_b). Regional roots per lane leaf, meeting only at registered seams (r1 gate: one lane root of 32,978 sinks failed the measured >15k insertion/spread rule; s2 EARLY_FAIL_HOLD from per-stage roots): clk = pin registers + stages 0-3+5-7 (~13.2k), clk_sfu stage-4 SFU (~10.8k), clk_ins / clk_ins2 insertion regions 0-1 / 2-3 (21.8k in all), clk_side[5:0] the SIDE pipe six-root partition (41.8k in all); seams = stage-3 registers -> SFU/insertion inputs and their outputs -> stage-5 merge. OT_QMUL4_INCUT, recipe 4 (hold_budget die), sync regional reset (relays sample on the pin root). KIND2 carries the SIDE pipe inside (no side pins), outline 345.6 x 367.2 (87.6k flops, std ~63k um2; r3 first gate: clk_side 41,758 / clk_ins 21,784 sinks on one root each). Pins spread over the FULL W/E/S faces (pin_ranges proportional to bits, balanced placer, <= ~3.4/um); clock entries at the S-face centre beside the register mass (r3 KIND1 gate: N-corner entry, lane root TT insertion 455.9 / spread 131.1 ps).",
  "extra_paths": [],
  "benches": [
   {
    "name": "lane_exact",
    "cmd": "SU_LANE_SYNC_RST=1 SU_LANE_QMUL4_INCUT=1 SU_PINREG=1 bash tools/hbm_static/su_lane_leaf_run.sh {RUN}/bench/lane ot_hbm_su_static_kind2_lat4_leaf1_r4_physical 4 3 1 0",
    "expect": "pass",
    "pass_regex": "SU_LANE PASS",
    "min_count_regex": "outputs=(\\d+)",
    "threads": 4,
    "peak_ram_gb": 4,
    "needs": [
     "verilator"
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "lane_mutant_addr",
    "cmd": "SU_LANE_SYNC_RST=1 SU_LANE_QMUL4_INCUT=1 SU_PINREG=1 bash tools/hbm_static/su_lane_leaf_run.sh {RUN}/bench/lane_mut ot_hbm_su_static_kind2_lat4_leaf1_r4_physical 4 3 1 0 ADDR",
    "expect": "fail",
    "fail_regex": "SU_LANE FAIL",
    "threads": 4,
    "peak_ram_gb": 4,
    "needs": [
     "verilator"
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "lane_mutant_data",
    "cmd": "SU_LANE_SYNC_RST=1 SU_LANE_QMUL4_INCUT=1 SU_PINREG=1 bash tools/hbm_static/su_lane_leaf_run.sh {RUN}/bench/lane_mut_data ot_hbm_su_static_kind2_lat4_leaf1_r4_physical 4 3 1 0 DATA",
    "expect": "fail",
    "fail_regex": "SU_LANE FAIL",
    "threads": 4,
    "peak_ram_gb": 4,
    "needs": [
     "verilator"
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "lane_mutant_phase",
    "cmd": "SU_LANE_SYNC_RST=1 SU_LANE_QMUL4_INCUT=1 SU_PINREG=1 bash tools/hbm_static/su_lane_leaf_run.sh {RUN}/bench/lane_mut_phase ot_hbm_su_static_kind2_lat4_leaf1_r4_physical 4 3 1 0 PHASE",
    "expect": "fail",
    "fail_regex": "SU_LANE FAIL",
    "threads": 4,
    "peak_ram_gb": 4,
    "needs": [
     "verilator"
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "lane_mutant_reset",
    "cmd": "SU_LANE_SYNC_RST=1 SU_LANE_QMUL4_INCUT=1 SU_PINREG=1 bash tools/hbm_static/su_lane_leaf_run.sh {RUN}/bench/reset_mut ot_hbm_su_static_kind2_lat4_leaf1_r4_physical 4 3 1 0 RESET",
    "expect": "fail",
    "fail_regex": "SU_LANE FAIL",
    "threads": 4,
    "peak_ram_gb": 4,
    "needs": [
